  "title": "Places in town and directions",
  "note": "A + el contracts to al, and de + el to del: Voy al banco; Está cerca del parque. A la and de la never contract. Ir (to go) is irregular: voy, vas, va, vamos, vais, van. Location phrases use estar with de: cerca de (near), lejos de (far from), al lado de (next to), enfrente de (across from).",
